s Impairment.","Once awakened, gains increased Movement Speed and loses damage reduction effect"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.3,"stats":{"hp":3000,"atk":300,"def":120,"res":5,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":1.5}},"sleepwalking_valet":{"slug":"sleepwalking_valet","name":"Sleepwalking Valet","icon":"/enemies-icons/Sleepwalking Valet.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Valet puppet that wanders the Castle of Dreams in the long night, laying out soft and comfortable bedding for all the rooms, and punishing bad people who invade the castle.","abilities":["Under Moonlight, Attack Range expands and ATK increases; returns to original status after several attacks"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.8,"stats":{"hp":25000,"atk":850,"def":800,"res":20,"elementalRes":0,"elementalDamageRes":0,"attackInterval":5.5}},"morpheus":{"slug":"morpheus","name":"Morpheus","icon":"/enemies-icons/Morpheus.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"Why would anyone want to escape the dream? Stay here, where everything is fun.","abilities":["Morpheus unleashes threads that can be blocked by your units; each unblocked thread increases Morpheus' ATK","First Form","[Binding Dream] Connects a thread to the furthest allied unit within Attack Range, dealing continuous Arts damage","[Dissociative Sensation] Connects to enemies with threads, causing most of the damage taken by Morpheus to be split among them","[Evolution of Dream] Morpheus summons and rides a 'Sleep Companion Beast', becomes unblockable, gains increased Movement Speed and Barrier; ends after some time has passed, or if the Barrier is destroyed","Second Form","When defeated for the first time, deals Arts damage to the whole field several times; when in 2n